      "message": "fix(age-review): correct Keycast path and Zendesk Issue field (#87)\n\n* fix(age-review): correct Keycast API path and Zendesk Issue field value\n\nKeycast admin endpoint is /api/admin/users/:pubkey/status, not\n/admin/users/:pubkey/status. The wrong path hit SvelteKit's catch-all\nand returned 405.\n\nZendesk Issue field value 'age_review' is not a valid dropdown option,\ncausing 422 when solving tickets. Changed to 'content_report_under_16'.\n\n* test: update age-review test assertions for content_report_under_16\n\nTwo test expectations still referenced the old 'age_review' Zendesk\nIssue field value after the production code was changed.",
