      "message": "config: wire Zendesk credentials via Secrets Store bindings (#86)\n\nAdd secrets_store_secrets bindings for ZENDESK_SUBDOMAIN,\nZENDESK_API_TOKEN, ZENDESK_EMAIL, and ZENDESK_AGE_REVIEW_WEBHOOK_SECRET\nto staging and prod wrangler configs. Update env interfaces and\ncredential resolution to handle SecretStoreSecret objects using shared\nhelpers (resolveZendeskCreds, resolveSecret).\n\nFix fire-and-forget updateZendeskTicket call to use awaited try/catch.\nAdd protective comments on plain-string Zendesk secrets that are passed\ndirectly to crypto APIs. Deduplicate resolveString by having age-review\ndelegate to resolveZendeskCreds from zendesk-sync.\n\nAll Zendesk integration code was already built with graceful no-op when\ncredentials are absent. This provisions the bindings so the features\nactivate once the corresponding Secrets Store entries are created.",
