      },
      "message": "cleanup: remove unused Create Label button from report detail (#84)\n\nThe inline label form was scaffolded in Dec 2025 but never became part\nof the moderation workflow. The AI moderation service auto-publishes\nkind 1985 labels, and moderators act via direct RPC actions (ban,\nsuspend, delete). The button had a UX bug where clicking it hid the\nbutton and rendered the form in a different scroll zone, making it\nappear broken.\n\nThe standalone LabelPublisher component and Labels tab are retained.",
