      "message": "fix: use real hostname in moderation service binding fetch (#85)\n\nThe service binding fetch used a fake `https://internal/...` hostname,\nassuming Cloudflare would ignore it for routing. The moderation service\nvalidates the request hostname against an allowlist and rejected\n`internal` with a 404, breaking bulk age-restrict-all actions.",
